    "headline": "Chinese chipmaker CXMT soars 500% on debut as AI fuels shortages",
    "summary": "China's leading memory chipmaker CXMT became the most valuable company in the mainland after soaring more than 500 percent on its market debut Monday, underscoring how AI demand is boosting the semiconductor sector.The firm's shares rocketed 530 percent Monday, taking its market capitalisation to 3.65 trillion yuan ($540 billion) -- surpassing megabank ICBC as mainland China's most valuable company.",
